    #       hash of its blob there (the one planning's brief gave); the base
    #       holds P1's doc commit's blob, a control the pin refuses; specs/0044
    #       unchanged in the range, another. The doc commit's files: specs/0045
    #       and ROADMAP.md, modified, two "<path> sha256 <blob>" pairs in its
